{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>אלי גיל</b> — Some say: גיל is a term used both for joy and for mourning, like רנה. Others say: its meaning is like those who are glad to go to גיל, so they rejoice. He went back and specified who among those who wait for death — it is he."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:38.220405711Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}